{
  "announcement_changelog": "### Changed\n\n- Documentation only, with no change to any score.",
  "announcement_github_body": "## Release Notes\n\n### Changed\n\n- Documentation only, with no change to any score.\n\n## Install bonsai-lint 0.2.1\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install ryckakas/tap/bonsai-lint\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries into your npm project\n\n```sh\nnpm install bonsai-lint@0.2.1\n```\n\n## Download bonsai-lint 0.2.1\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [bonsai-lint-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [bonsai-lint-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [bonsai-lint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [bonsai-lint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [bonsai-lint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/ryckakas/bonsai-lint/releases/download/v0.2.1/bonsai-lint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n",
